'''Gingerscope''' is an [[Ancient Weapons|ancient]] gun that was originally obtainable by purchasing the 20th tier in the Battle Pass for 98,000 [[Snow Tokens]] {{Currency|Snow Token}} during the [[Christmas Event 2023|2023 Christmas Event]]. It is now only obtainable through trading as the event has since ended.'''

=='''Appearance'''==
It resembles a tactical sniper rifle made entirely of gingerbread, along with a scope attachment on it on the top, hence the name. The gingerbread is decorated with faint white icing and small pieces of candy along the left side, body and wedge. The handle is made of red and white striped peppermint, and on the middle of the scope is a small peppermint infused on it.

=='''Trivia'''==
*It is the eighth ancient weapon to be obtained by purchasing the final tier in an event, the others being [[Elderwood Scythe]], [[Logchopper]], [[Hallowscythe]], [[Icebreaker]], [[Harvester]], [[Icepiercer]], [[Traveler's Axe]] and [[Swirly Axe]].
*It is the third gun in [[Murder Mystery 2]] to have a unique shooting sound effect when you use it, others being [[Harvester]], [[Icepiercer]], [[Raygun]], [[Chroma Raygun]], [[Snowcannon]], [[Chroma Snowcannon]], [[Emberbow]] and [[Chroma Emberbow]].
*There are [[Gold Gingerscope|gold]], [[Silver Gingerscope|silver]], [[Bronze Gingerscope|bronze]] and [[Blue Gingerscope|blue]] variants of this weapon, which were awarded as [[Unique Weapons|unique]] [[:Category:Trophy Items|trophy Items]] for getting on the [[Christmas Event 2023#Leaderboard|2023 Christmas Leaderboard]].
*This weapon has a unique shooting trail that is red and white.
*This is the first gun in the game to have a custom holding/idle animation.
*This is the first weapon in [[Murder Mystery 2]] to have the [[FX Weapons|FX]] tag, colored "Yellow".
*It was designed by [[IDontHaveAUse]].
*It partners with the [[Evo Weapons|Evo]] knife [[Gingerscythe]].
*It has lately been partnered with the uncommon knife, [[Gingerheart]], from the Christmas 2024 Tier Rewards, mainly due to Gingerscythe being untradable.
*Gingerscope is highly wanted by the playerbase for being a unique weapon.

